    "%@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "A size in the Page Size menu of the developer tools above the page: its name, then its width and height, like “iPhone, 393 × 852”.\nAccessibility label of the address in the sidebar on a plain http page: the site, then that it's not secure.\nOn the Permissions row of the site panel: how many allowed, then how many blocked, like “2 allowed, 1 blocked”.\nUnder a download's name in the downloads panel: how much has come, then the time left, like 3.7 of 9 MB, a minute left.\nVoiceOver name of a command bar result: its title, then what's under it.\nVoiceOver name of a download in the downloads panel: the file's name, then what's under it.\nVoiceOver name of the page's whole address in the developer tools' bar on a plain http page: the address, then that it's not secure.\nWhat VoiceOver says for a row in the Passwords window: the site, then the username.\nWhat VoiceOver says for a space in the space switcher with more than one profile: the space's name, then its profile's.",
