    "%@’s passwords and sign-ins stayed locked. Click Try Again, type your Mac’s password when macOS asks, and click Allow." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome; Try Again is a button here, Allow is macOS's own button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的密码和登录状态仍处于锁定状态。请点按“再试一次”，在 macOS 询问时输入你的 Mac 密码，然后点按“允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@’s passwords are in a format Zigzag can’t read. Export them from %@’s Passwords page as a CSV file, then choose it here." : {
