    },
    "Firefox Add-ons didn’t answer, so this extension couldn’t be checked and wasn’t added. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when Add to Firefox on addons.mozilla.org was clicked but the store's API couldn't be reached to check the file.",
