          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也可以在小播放器的右键菜单里关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let this extension reach apps on this Mac" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label of the apps-on-this-Mac switch under an extension in Settings › Extensions.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许此扩展访问这台 Mac 上的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets this extension’s own code read what a program listening on this Mac answers, over loopback only. Without it, the program’s own CORS rules decide. Off until you turn it on." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the apps-on-this-Mac switch on an extension’s row in Settings › Extensions. CORS is a web API name: keep it as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许此扩展自身的代码读取这台 Mac 上监听程序返回的内容，且只限本机回环。关闭时由程序自身的 CORS 规则决定。在你开启之前保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow websites to reach apps on this Mac" : {
      "comment" : "A setting in Settings › Privacy: the master switch for a site’s scripts reaching a program listening on this Mac. Also its accessibility label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许网站访问这台 Mac 上的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On battery, Clear shows as Frosted to save power." : {
      "comment" : "Under Glass in the space editor, while the Mac runs on its battery: clear glass shows as frosted until it's plugged in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用电池时，“透明”会显示为“磨砂”以节省电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
