    "Extension" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of an extension's menu when the extension has no name.\nName on an extension's side panel when the extension has none.\nThe address bar's name for an extension's own page, when the extension has no name.\nVoiceOver label of the icon before an extension's address in a pop-up window.",
