    "Extensions" : {
      "comment" : "A section of Settings.\nChoice in the Import window: bring extensions over from the Chrome Web Store.\nHeading in the site panel, in the welcome window’s picture of Zigzag.\nLabel in the sheet that makes a profile: which extensions it starts with.\nRow in the site panel's This Site group.\nSection label in Site Controls over your extensions, which folds them away; also the title of the panel on a new tab.",
