        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次会重新载入它的页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its settings and data on this Mac are deleted too. You can add it again from the Chrome Web Store." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before removing an extension.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它在这台 Mac 上的设置和数据也会被删除。你可以从 Chrome 网上应用店重新添加它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its sign-ins, history, favorites and extensions are deleted, with everything the extensions hold, wallets included." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that deletes a profile. More sentences may follow.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的登录状态、历史记录、收藏和扩展都会被删除，扩展保存的所有内容（包括钱包）也会一并删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its spaces move to %@." : {
      "comment" : "Added to the message of the sheet that deletes a profile, when the profile has spaces. The placeholder is the first profile's name.",
      "localizations" : {
