      "comment" : "A command in the command bar, named as in the menu bar.\nA section of Settings.\nChoice in the Import window: bring passwords over.\nLink at the bottom of the menu that fills a password into a page: opens the Passwords window.\nTitle of the Passwords window.\nTitle over the column of kinds in the Passwords window.\nWhat VoiceOver calls the menu that fills a password into a page.\nZigzag menu item.",
