    "Swipe or click a dot anytime, or press %@ and %@" : {
      "comment" : "Under what's said once the switching spaces step is done, in the getting-started guide, a card in the window. The keys are shortcuts, like ⌥⌘← and ⌥⌘→.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Swipe or click a dot anytime, or press %1$@ and %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随时轻扫或点按圆点，也可以按 %1$@ 和 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe to go back and forward" : {
      "comment" : "A setting in Settings › Tabs: two fingers sideways on the trackpad go back or forward.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻扫以后退和前进"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe two fingers across the sidebar, or click its dot" : {
      "comment" : "Under a step's title in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在边栏上双指轻扫，或点按它的圆点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch Space…" : {
      "comment" : "View menu item: lists the spaces to pick one with the arrow keys.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换空间…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to %@" : {
      "comment" : "A command in the command bar: goes to another space. The name is the space's.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换到“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to Tab" : {
      "comment" : "Action label at the right of the selected command bar result, saying what Return does: goes to the open tab.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换到标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to your new space" : {
      "comment" : "The last step's title in the getting-started guide, a card in the window, when you're still in the space you started in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换到你的新空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System (%@)" : {
      "comment" : "First choice of the Language menu in Settings › General. The placeholder is the language the Mac would pick, named in itself.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab %lld" : {
      "comment" : "Hidden View menu item that goes to the tab with this number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标签页 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs" : {
      "comment" : "A section of Settings.\nThe quiet label above today's tabs in the sidebar, below the pinned tabs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take Screenshot of Whole Page" : {
      "comment" : "File menu item.\nTooltip of the Capture action in the site panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为整个页面截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taken from “%@”, which has no shortcut now" : {
      "comment" : "Under a shortcut in Settings › Shortcuts, after it took keys from another command; that command's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取自“%@”，它现在没有快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking a screenshot of the whole page…" : {
      "comment" : "Toast while Zigzag takes a screenshot of the whole page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在为整个页面截图…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to an app on your Mac" : {
      "comment" : "One thing an extension can do, in its install sheet and in Settings: exchange messages with an app installed on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你 Mac 上的 App 通信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to the 1Password app on your Mac" : {
      "comment" : "One thing an extension can do, in its install sheet and in Settings: exchange messages with an app installed on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你 Mac 上的 1Password App 通信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to the Bitwarden app on your Mac" : {
      "comment" : "One thing an extension can do, in its install sheet and in Settings: exchange messages with an app installed on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你 Mac 上的 Bitwarden App 通信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teal" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver, in the space editor's color wheel: a color's family.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "青色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us what works, what doesn’t, and what you’d like. Email reaches the developer directly. GitHub Issues are public, so leave out anything personal." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the Send Feedback sheet. GitHub Issues is a product name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告诉我们哪些好用、哪些不好用，以及你想要什么。电子邮件会直接发给开发者。GitHub Issues 是公开的，请不要写入任何个人信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test a Rule" : {
      "comment" : "A heading in Settings › Downloads, over the address field that shows which rule would take it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test an address" : {
      "comment" : "A setting in Settings › Downloads: a field to type an address and see which rule takes it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testable" : {
      "comment" : "A heading in Settings › Developer › Feature Flags, as Safari has it: WebKit features ready to test, not ready to ship.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text %@, Actual Size" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver name of the percentage on Reader's Text Size row: the size now, then what pressing it does.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字 %@，实际大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text %lld%%" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when Reader's text size changes, like Text 120%.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Replacement" : {
      "comment" : "Edit › Substitutions menu item.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本替换"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size" : {
      "comment" : "Row in Reader's text and color choices: the − 100% + stepper.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for trying Zigzag. I made it to be a calm home for everything you do on the web. I hope it feels that way." : {
      "comment" : "Thank-you note from the maker at the end of the getting-started guide, a card in the window, signed by him.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢你试用 Zigzag。我做它，是想给你在网上做的一切一个安静的家。希望它给你的感觉也是这样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That can’t be zapped. Try something around it." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the element clicked with Zap Element can't be named well enough to hide on later visits.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个部分无法隐藏，试试它外面的一层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That disk can’t be written to" : {
      "comment" : "Why a file couldn't be saved, said after what failed, like “Couldn’t save the page. Not enough space on your Mac.”",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入该磁盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That folder needs a manifest.json that Zigzag can read. Choose the folder that holds it." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the notice when an unpacked extension can't load. manifest.json is a file name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件夹需要一个 Zigzag 能读取的 manifest.json。请选取包含它的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t %@’s primary password. Check it and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Firefox; primary password is Firefox's own term.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是 %@ 的主密码。请检查后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t an address." : {
      "comment" : "Under the test address in Settings › Downloads, when what was typed can't be a URL.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是有效的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That name or password didn’t work. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message in the sheet a site's HTTP sign-in asks with, after a wrong name or password.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该名称或密码无效。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That tab isn’t in this window." : {
      "comment" : "Error a script gets when it makes a tab from another window the current tab.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该标签页不在这个窗口中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s Split View" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这就是分屏浏览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s every port of %@, not only %@." : {
      "comment" : "Added to the message of the sheet that asks before clearing one site's cache or cookies, on a development site whose address has a port, like localhost:3000. The first placeholder is the site, the second the port's number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "That’s every port of %1$@, not only %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会清除 %1$@ 的所有端口，而不只是 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s switching spaces" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这就是切换空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s too long for a style. Keep it under 100 KB." : {
      "comment" : "Under the code field of the Edit Style sheet, while the CSS is too long: why Save can't be pressed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "样式太长了，请控制在 100 KB 以内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this on, the first file a site sends asks whether it may. A site you allow keeps its answer; with this off, downloads save as they always did." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Ask before a site downloads files” in Settings › Privacy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，网站发来第一个文件时会先询问是否允许。允许过的网站会记住答案；关闭后，下载会和以前一样直接保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Last Hour…" : {
      "comment" : "Item in the Clear History menu on the History page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去一小时…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Page" : {
      "comment" : "A choice for “Full screen videos fill” in Settings › Tabs: a video in full screen fills the page's area in the window, with the sidebar and the rest of the window still there.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The URL isn’t valid." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the URL it was told to open can't be made.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个网址无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Whole Screen" : {
      "comment" : "A choice for “Full screen videos fill” in Settings › Tabs: a video in full screen covers the whole screen, as usual.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整个屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Zigzag name, the app icon and the logo are trademarks of Zigao Wang, all rights reserved. They aren’t covered by the Apache License: see [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md)." : {
      "comment" : "In the Acknowledgments window. Keep the Markdown link [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md) as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 名称、App 图标和标志是 Zigao Wang 的商标，保留所有权利。它们不在 Apache License 的授权范围内：请参阅 [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address may have a typo, or your Mac may not be connected to the internet. Check both, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地址可能有误，或者你的 Mac 可能没有连接到互联网。请检查这两项，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address uses a port kept for other things, like email, so browsers don’t open it." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此地址使用的端口留作电子邮件等其他用途，所以浏览器不会打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is deleted from your Applications folder. You stay signed in to the site in Zigzag." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that removes a site installed as an app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 会从“应用程序”文件夹中删除。你在 Zigzag 中的网站登录状态不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is no longer there." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the app it was told to open is gone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该 App 已不在了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection dropped" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接已中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer tools show on this site, on every port and on its subdomains." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the sheet that turns Developer Mode on for a site, from Settings › Developer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发者工具会在这个网站上显示，包括它的所有端口和子域名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn’t protected: anyone who opens it can read every password. Keep it somewhere safe and delete it when you’re done." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that confirms exporting passwords.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件未受保护：任何打开它的人都能读取所有密码。请把它存放在安全的地方，用完后删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file still holds your passwords unprotected. It’s safer to move it to the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, after passwords came over from an exported file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件中的密码仍未受保护。将它移到废纸篓会更安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free encyclopedia" : {
      "comment" : "Wikipedia’s tagline, on a sample page in the welcome window’s picture of Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自由的百科全书"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iCloud Passwords extension is installed too. You can remove it in Settings › Extensions." : {
      "comment" : "Under “Password manager” in Settings › Passwords, with Zigzag chosen while Apple's iCloud Passwords extension is still installed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 密码扩展也已安装，你可以在“设置 › 扩展”中移除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language you read." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Translate pages into” in Settings › Translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你阅读时使用的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ones you use in %@, each downloaded from the Chrome Web Store and checked as if you added it here. You can turn any of them off in Settings › Extensions." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, when asking before adding the extensions found. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome, or a list of them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是你在 %@ 中使用的扩展，每个都从 Chrome 网上应用店下载，并像你在这里亲自添加时一样经过检查。你可以随时在“设置 › 扩展”中关闭其中任何一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page belongs to an extension that has been removed or turned off. Turn it back on in Settings › Extensions, or close this tab." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此页面属于一个已被移除或关闭的扩展。请在“设置 › 扩展”中重新打开它，或者关闭此标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page meets the window’s edges instead of floating inside it. Hold ⌥⌘ and drag anywhere on the page to move the window." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Borderless page” in Settings › Appearance. ⌥⌘ are the Option and Command keys.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "页面直接贴合窗口边缘，而不是浮在窗口中。按住 ⌥⌘ 在网页任意位置拖动，即可移动窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The parameters aren’t valid JSON." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the JSON-RPC parameters don't parse.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "参数不是有效的 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile this was going into has been deleted. Choose another and import again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window, when the profile chosen under Into was deleted before the import ran.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要导入到的个人资料已被删除。请选取其他个人资料，然后重新导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile this was going to has been deleted. Nothing was added." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the profile chosen in the sheet that adds an extension was deleted before the extension went in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要添加到的个人资料已被删除，未添加任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request couldn’t be built." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: its JSON-RPC body can't be made.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法生成请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result can’t be given as text. For a promise, put await before it and return its value." : {
      "comment" : "Error a script gets when its JavaScript ends on a value like a promise or a page element.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结果无法以文本形式返回。如果是 Promise，请在前面加上 await 并 return 它的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The script exited with status %d." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the script finished with an error code. The placeholder is a number, like 1.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "脚本以状态 %d 退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The script failed: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the script exited with an error code and printed this. The placeholder is the script's own last line of error text.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "脚本运行失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The script is no longer there." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the script it was told to run is gone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该脚本已不在了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secure connection was cut off, often by the network you’re on. Try again, or try another network." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安全连接被切断了，通常是你所在的网络造成的。请再试一次，或换一个网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service answered %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the service's HTTP status. The placeholder is a number, like 401.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务返回了 %lld。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service’s address isn’t valid." : {
      "comment" : "Why a download rule failed: the JSON-RPC endpoint can't be made into a URL.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个服务的地址无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site couldn’t send it" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站无法发送该文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site may be down right now. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站现在可能无法访问。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site only opens for Macs with a certificate it trusts, often one from work or school." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站只对带有它信任的证书的 Mac 开放，这种证书通常来自工作单位或学校。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site refused it" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站拒绝了该请求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site signed its certificate itself, so nobody your Mac trusts vouches for it. Sites on your own network, like a router, often look like this." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it: it's self-signed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书是它自己签发的，没有你的 Mac 信任的机构为它担保。你自己网络上的网站（比如路由器）常常是这样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate can’t be trusted. Someone could be pretending to be this site." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it, when it isn't known why.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书不可信。可能有人在冒充这个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate expired on %@. The site may not have renewed it, or your Mac’s date and time are wrong." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it. The placeholder is the day it expired, like November 14, 2026.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书已于%@过期。可能是网站没有续期，或者你 Mac 的日期和时间不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate has expired, or your Mac’s date and time are wrong." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书已过期，或者你 Mac 的日期和时间不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate is for a different address, %@. Someone could be pretending to be this site." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it. The placeholder is the address the certificate is for, like *.example.com.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
