          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate is for a different address. Someone could be pretending to be this site." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书属于另一个地址。可能有人在冒充这个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate isn’t valid until %@. Check your Mac’s date and time." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it. The placeholder is the first day it's valid, like November 14, 2026.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
