    },
    "This page was reloaded because your Mac was low on memory" : {
      "comment" : "Toast after a page loaded again because macOS ended it while memory was short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 内存不足，此页面已重新载入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This password is easy to guess. Change it on the site, and use a strong password Zigzag makes for you." : {
      "comment" : "Warning on a weak password in the Passwords window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个密码很容易被猜到。请在网站上更改它，并使用 Zigzag 为你生成的强密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This password is used on other sites. If one of them leaks, this account is at risk too. Change it on the site, then update it here." : {
      "comment" : "Warning on a reused password in the Passwords window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个密码在其他网站上也在使用。只要其中一个泄露，这个账户也会有风险。请在网站上更改它，然后在这里更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site asks to be visited only over a secure connection, so it can’t be opened with this certificate." : {
      "comment" : "Under Details on the page Zigzag shows for a site whose certificate can't be trusted, in place of Visit this site anyway, for a site that uses HSTS.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此网站要求只通过安全连接访问，所以无法用这个证书打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site can’t prove it is who it says it is, so Zigzag didn’t open it. Someone could be pretending to be it to see what you send." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows for a site whose certificate can't be trusted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此网站无法证明自己的身份，所以 Zigzag 没有打开它。可能有人在冒充它，想看到你发送的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site hasn’t asked for anything yet." : {
      "comment" : "On a site's Permissions page in the site panel when the site hasn't asked for the camera, location, notifications or anything else.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此网站还没有请求过任何权限。"
