        }
      }
    },
    "To always translate a language, choose it from the translate button in the address bar." : {
      "comment" : "Under Always Translate in Settings › Translation, when there's no language. The translate button is in the address bar on pages in another language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要始终翻译一种语言，请在地址栏的翻译按钮里选择它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To bring over Safari’s bookmarks and history, export them from Safari (File › Export Browsing Data to File) and choose that file here. Nothing else needs your permission." : {
      "comment" : "Note in the Import window. File › Export Browsing Data to File is Safari's own menu wording.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要导入 Safari 的书签和历史记录，请从 Safari 导出（文件 › 将浏览数据导出到文件），然后在这里选择该文件。其他内容无需你的许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To separate them, press %@" : {
      "comment" : "Under what's said once the split view step is done, in the getting-started guide, a card in the window. The keys are a shortcut, like ⌥⌘\\.",
