    "Try Again" : {
      "comment" : "Button in the Passwords window after the passwords couldn't be read.\nButton in the toast when a download fails.\nButton on the bar over a Chrome Web Store page after installing failed.\nButton on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.\nButton under a problem in the Import window.\nTooltip of a download's button in the downloads panel: downloads the file again.",
