    "WebRTC, which sites use for calls, can show them your real IP address even while you use a proxy or VPN. When on, it’s off except on sites you allow in Site Controls." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Protect IP address from WebRTC” in Settings › Privacy. WebRTC is a name: keep it as it is. Site Controls is the panel from the address.",
