          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你仍然可以从导出的 .csv 文件导入密码，从导出的 .html 文件导入书签，或从 Safari 导出的 .zip 文件导入书签和历史记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You searched YouTube from here" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你刚才从这里搜索了 YouTube"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac doesn’t let Zigzag open it." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 不允许 Zigzag 打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac sends pages through a proxy (%@). The address may have a typo, or the proxy couldn’t reach the site. Check the address, or try again with the proxy off." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load through a proxy on this Mac (like Clash). The placeholder is the proxy's address, like 127.0.0.1:7890.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 通过代理（%@）打开网页。地址可能有误，或者代理连不上这个网站。请检查地址，或关掉代理再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Profiles" : {
      "comment" : "A heading in Settings › Profiles.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的个人资料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Spaces" : {
      "comment" : "A heading in Settings › Spaces.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name, email, phone and address, from your own card in Contacts." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Fill forms from My Card” in Settings › Passwords.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的姓名、电子邮件、电话和地址，来自你在“通讯录”中的名片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your new space" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的新空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your passwords are locked. Unlock with Touch ID or your Mac’s password." : {
      "comment" : "Shown in the locked Passwords window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的密码已锁定。请使用触控 ID 或你的 Mac 密码解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your passwords are saved in Zigzag, in your Mac’s Keychain, and sync with iCloud Keychain. Find them in Zigzag › Passwords." : {
      "comment" : "Import window when the import is done. Zigzag › Passwords is the menu item's path; Keychain and iCloud Keychain are Apple's names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的密码存储在 Zigzag 中，保存在你 Mac 的钥匙串里，并通过 iCloud 钥匙串同步。可以在“Zigzag › 密码”中找到它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone needs to be on the same network as this Mac, and your development server needs to listen on it too, not only on localhost (for most, a host of 0.0.0.0)." : {
      "comment" : "Under the address in the Open on Your Phone sheet of the developer tools. 0.0.0.0 is a server setting, kept as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机需要和这台 Mac 连接同一个网络，你的开发服务器也需要在这个网络上监听，而不只是 localhost（多数情况下把主机设为 0.0.0.0）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-ins from %@ couldn’t come over, so sites will ask you to sign in again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome. Sign-ins are the sites a browser keeps you signed in to.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 中的登录状态未能导入，所以网站会要求你重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your spaces, tabs, favorites and history go back to how they were before the last update, and Zigzag restarts. Logins and passwords aren’t affected." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that restores the backup.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的空间、标签页、收藏和历史记录会恢复到上次更新之前的样子，然后 Zigzag 会重新启动。登录信息和密码不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tabs and spaces are saved, and History › Reopen Last Session brings them back." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before quitting, with On launch set to Start Fresh: the next launch opens a new window, and the session is reopened from the History menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的标签页和空间都已保存，“历史记录 › 重新打开上次会话”可以再把它们带回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tabs and spaces will be right here when you open it again." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before quitting; “it” is Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次打开时，你的标签页和空间都会在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your windows and tabs come back as they are. Or it switches the next time you open Zigzag." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet after picking a language in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的窗口和标签页会原样回来。也可以等下次打开 Zigzag 时再切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of %@, and its pages load fresh next time." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that removes one site's data.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将退出 %@ 的登录，下次会重新载入它的页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of %@. Other sites aren’t touched." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before clearing one site's cookies.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将退出 %@ 的登录。其他网站不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of every site, and pages load fresh next time. Your passwords, pinned tabs and history stay." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that removes every site's data, from Remove All in Settings › Privacy › Stored by Websites.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将在所有网站上退出登录，下次会重新载入页面。你的密码、已固定标签页和历史记录会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of every site. Your passwords, pinned tabs and history stay." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before clearing every site's cookies.\nMessage of the sheet that clears cookies.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将在所有网站上退出登录。你的密码、已固定标签页和历史记录会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of them, and their pages load fresh next time." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that removes the data of the sites a search shows in Settings › Privacy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将在这些网站上退出登录，下次会重新载入它们的页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Import window when the import is done.\nTitle of the getting-started guide, a card in the window once every step is done.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re offline" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.\nWhy a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已离线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re signed in to your sites here too, and everything else is in your sidebar. You can bring more over anytime from Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Import window when the import is done and sign-ins came over.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在这里也已登录你的网站，其他所有内容都在你的边栏中。你可以随时从“设置”导入更多内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zap Element" : {
      "comment" : "Item in the … menu of the site panel: pick elements on the page to hide on this site, like Arc's Zap.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏元素"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigao, who makes Zigzag" : {
      "comment" : "Signature under the thank-you note at the end of the getting-started guide, a card in the window. Zigao is the maker's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigao，Zigzag 的作者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag %@ is ready. Restart to update." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip and VoiceOver label of the sidebar's update card. The placeholder is the version.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag %@ 已就绪，重新启动即可更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t read that file as a picture. Choose a photo or an image file, like a JPEG, PNG or HEIC." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the notice when a picture chosen for a space's empty page can't be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法将该文件读取为图像。请选取照片或图像文件，例如 JPEG、PNG 或 HEIC。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag Mini" : {
      "comment" : "The name of Zigzag's small window for one page, without the sidebar (Arc called it Little Arc). Kept in Latin letters, like the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag Mini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag Passwords.csv" : {
      "comment" : "The file name suggested when exporting passwords. Keep .csv.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 密码.csv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t open this address" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法打开此地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t read this file" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法读取此文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag can’t read your card. Allow it in System Settings › Privacy › Contacts, and set My Card in Contacts." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when filling a form from Contacts isn't allowed. System Settings › Privacy › Contacts and My Card are names macOS uses; match them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法读取你的名片。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 通讯录”中允许访问，并在“通讯录”中设置“我的名片”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t find a password field it can see on this page. Copy the password from Passwords instead." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when a login or strong password was picked but the page has no visible password field to put it in. Passwords is the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 在这个页面上找不到看得见的密码框。请到“密码”里拷贝密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t find fields for your card that it can see here." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when Fill from My Card was picked but no visible name, email, phone or address field on the page could take it. My Card is the person's own card in Contacts, as macOS calls it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 在这里找不到看得见的、能填写名片信息的输入框。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t move it to the Trash. Show it in Finder and delete it there." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, when the exported passwords file couldn't be moved to the Trash.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能将它移到废纸篓。请在“访达”中显示它，然后在那里删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t open %@’s passwords. Quit %@, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Zigzag couldn’t open %1$@’s passwords. Quit %2$@, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能打开 %1$@ 的密码。请退出 %2$@，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read Arc’s history. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Arc is a browser's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取 Arc 的历史记录。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read Arc’s spaces and pinned tabs. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Arc is a browser's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取 Arc 的空间和已固定标签页。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read Dia’s pinned tabs. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Dia is a browser's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取 Dia 的已固定标签页。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read the passwords it already has, so it didn’t add any. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能读取它已有的密码，所以没有添加任何密码。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read the site’s certificate, so it can’t be trusted anyway." : {
      "comment" : "Under Details on the page Zigzag shows for a site whose certificate can't be trusted, in place of Visit this site anyway, when the certificate couldn't be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法读取该网站的证书，所以无法仍然信任它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t read your profiles, so every space is on Default for now. The file was kept." : {
      "comment" : "Toast at launch when the file listing the profiles couldn't be read and was set aside. Default is the first profile's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无法读取你的个人资料，所有空间暂时位于“默认”。该文件已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t save your tabs and spaces" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when Zigzag can't write its library of spaces and tabs; a reason may follow as its own sentence.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能存储你的标签页和空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag has a blocker built in. Pages load faster, with fewer trackers." : {
      "comment" : "Line under the title of the welcome window’s ad blocking step.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 内置了拦截器。页面载入更快，跟踪器更少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is made by Zigao Wang and is open source under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It builds on the work of others, listed below with their licenses. Thank you." : {
      "comment" : "First paragraph of the Acknowledgments window. “Apache License, Version 2.0” is the license's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 由 Zigao Wang 制作，依据 Apache License, Version 2.0 开源。它建立在他人的成果之上，下面列出了这些作品及其许可证。谢谢你们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is running from the disk image or a download, where it can’t update itself. In Applications, updates install on their own." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet offering to move the app into the Applications folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 正从磁盘映像或下载位置运行，无法自行更新。放进“应用程序”文件夹后，更新会自动安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is up to date." : {
      "comment" : "Toast after Check for Updates… finds no newer version.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is your default browser" : {
      "comment" : "In Settings › General, in place of Set as Default once it's done.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 是你的默认浏览器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag isn’t allowed to save in that folder" : {
      "comment" : "Why a file couldn't be saved, said after what failed, like “Couldn’t save the page. Not enough space on your Mac.”",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 无权存储到该文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag made this strong password for a form on this site. It takes the place of the account’s saved password once the site accepts it; until then, the old one stays saved too." : {
      "comment" : "Note on a generated password in the Passwords window that the site hasn't been seen to accept yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是 Zigzag 为此网站上的表单生成的强密码。网站接受后，它会替换此账户已存储的密码；在此之前，旧密码也会继续保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag on GitHub" : {
      "comment" : "Help menu item.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub 上的 Zigzag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag updated to %@" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the note shown after an update, with the new version number, like 0.5.2.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 已更新到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag won’t offer to save passwords on this site. Allow it, and the next time you sign in there you’ll be asked again." : {
      "comment" : "Shown for a Never Saved site in the Passwords window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 不会在此网站上提示存储密码。允许后，下次你在那里登录时会再次询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag won’t open this port" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
