          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 仍在对它保密。在“系统设置”中打开一个开关即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask for your Mac’s password once. Type it, then click Allow." : {
